flowchart TD
    A[Market quotations, KESONIA, curves, positions, deposit and loan data] --> B[Quality checks, timestamps, calendars and methodology versions]
    B --> C[Build discount and projection curves; reprice input instruments]
    C --> D[Reconcile contractual and behavioural cash flows]
    D --> E[Calculate FTP, NII, EVE, LCR, NSFR, capital and collateral measures]
    E --> F[Generate governed rate, spread, deposit and liquidity scenarios]
    F --> G[Compare current policy, deterministic plans and candidate control policies]
    G --> H{All hard constraints and mandate checks pass?}
    H -->|No| I[Reject action; show binding constraint and feasible alternatives]
    H -->|Yes| J[Risk review: assumptions, uncertainty, stress and model limits]
    J --> K[ALCO or delegated human approval]
    K -->|Declined or changed| L[Record decision, reason and override]
    K -->|Approved| M[Authorized Treasury execution]
    M --> N[Settlement, accounting, collateral and limit monitoring]
    N --> O[Reconcile realized NII, EVE, funding cost and liquidity]
    O --> P[Update model monitoring and scenario assumptions]
    P --> B
